WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.380 --> 00:00:12.085
One of the self-regulation strategies
you can use is controlled breathing.

2
00:00:12.420 --> 00:00:14.857
So I'm going to teach you a few tricks

3
00:00:14.940 --> 00:00:16.940
so that you can do it effectively.

4
00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:21.097
First, I'd like you to sit
somewhere comfortable,

5
00:00:21.180 --> 00:00:23.718
with your feet firmly on the floor.

6
00:00:24.540 --> 00:00:29.197
Then, the aim is to breathe in through
your nose and out through your mouth.

7
00:00:29.280 --> 00:00:34.029
If it helps, you can think of smelling
a flower, blowing out a candle.

8
00:00:34.460 --> 00:00:38.417
Next, I'd like you to place one
of your hands on top of your chest

9
00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:40.587
and the other hand below your chest,

10
00:00:40.670 --> 00:00:43.650
so that you can feel
your breathing better.

11
00:00:45.780 --> 00:00:50.098
And now the aim is to breathe in,
hold and breathe out, ok?

12
00:00:52.320 --> 00:00:54.555
I'll do it with you to make it easier.

13
00:00:57.820 --> 00:00:59.304
Breathe in, hold,

14
00:01:00.480 --> 00:01:01.707
breathe out.

15
00:01:05.030 --> 00:01:07.351
Let's do this counting in seconds.

16
00:01:07.610 --> 00:01:10.447
Five seconds to breathe in,
three seconds to hold,

17
00:01:10.530 --> 00:01:12.573
five seconds to breathe out.

18
00:01:15.880 --> 00:01:17.178
Do it with me.

19
00:01:27.090 --> 00:01:30.467
With this breathing,
you should feel your chest, that is,

20
00:01:30.550 --> 00:01:33.639
both your hands rising at the same time.

21
00:01:35.790 --> 00:01:39.915
The air above and below your chest
has to come in at the same time.

22
00:01:40.390 --> 00:01:41.980
Let's do it again.

23
00:01:42.170 --> 00:01:45.819
Breathe in for five,
hold for three and breathe out for five.

24
00:01:57.830 --> 00:02:01.177
The aim of this breathing
is to renew the air in your lungs,

25
00:02:01.260 --> 00:02:04.777
slow down your heart
and focus you on a simple task

26
00:02:04.860 --> 00:02:08.566
that will make you think and bring
you into the present moment.
